  "reference": "1 Tham 18",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ ruac kɛ Thɔɔl, cu Jo-na-than Ɛ nhɔk ce̱tkɛ puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ cu te kɛɛl kɛn ɛ Thɔɔl niɛ cäŋ ɔ, /kenɛ jɛ lɛ nhök loc dhɔr gua̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-na-than ruac mat kɛnɛ Dee-bid, kɛ ɣöö nhɔkɛ jɛ ce̱tkɛ puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-na-than bi̱i̱dɛ in te puɔ̱ɔ̱nydɛ ka̱m Dee-bid, kɛnɛ thɛpdɛ, kɛ bäärɛ, amäni la̱a̱kdɛ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gua̱th diaal tin la Thɔɔl Dee-bid a jäk kä thi̱n, la gɔwkɛ kɛ jɛ. Cu Thɔɔl jɛ cu jak kä bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m. Kä cu lo̱c nɛɛni diaal tɛɛth, amäni bööth Thɔɔl bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyi̱er Thɔɔl kɛ Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min luny Dee-bid jɔk näk ran Pi-li-thɛt, cu män ben raar rɛy wi̱i̱ni I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, bäkɛ kä kuäär ni Thɔɔl tuarkɛ kä duthkɛ, kɛ tuaari tɛthkä lɔaac kɛ buɔ̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min duthkɛ, cukɛ tuar i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ cu yiëë mi jiääk mi bä kä Kuoth ben kä Thɔɔl, cuɛ yɔ̱ŋ niɛ dhɔrɛ, kä puɔ̱ɔ̱t Dee-bid thom ce̱tkɛ min wen. Kä Thɔɔl te mutdɛ tetädɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ mutdɛ kal nhial kiɛ riw, larɛ jɛ kɛ lɔcdɛ i̱, “Bä Dee-bid yiath puɔ̱ɔ̱ny duëël.” Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid ɛ kɔl ni kä rɛɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dual Thɔɔl kɛ Dee-bid, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial jiɛɛn kä jɛ, kä tëë kɛɛl kɛ Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Thɔɔl Dee-bid woc kutdɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ jak kä bo̱o̱th bathdɔɔrä. Kä cu Dee-bid nɛɛkɛ bo̱th ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tëë diaal tëë cɛ la̱t gɔw, kɛ ɣöö te Kuoth Nhial kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Thɔɔl ɛ nɛn i̱ gɔw ti diaal kɛ jɛ cuɛ dual kɛ Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Dee-bid nhɔk ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛnɛ ji̱ Juda. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ kɛ böth ko̱o̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuën Dee-bid kɛ nyaa Thɔɔl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Thɔɔl Dee-bid jiök i̱, “Nyaadä min di̱i̱t ni Me-rɛ̈b ɛn. Ɣän bä ka̱m ji̱ ala ciekdu. Bi lät ni ɣä ikä kɛ buɔ̱m, tɛr ko̱o̱ri Kuɔth Nhial.” Kɛ ɣöö car Thɔɔl ɛ kɛ lɔcdɛ i̱, “A jɛ /cä näk ɛ ɣän, a jɛ na̱kɛ ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Thɔɔl loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän ŋa kä ɛ dhɔra mia̱a̱ ni kä I-thɛ-rɛl, min dëë ɣän a cɔw nyaa Kua̱r kɛ jɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ gua̱a̱th in dëë Me-rɛ̈b nyaa Thɔɔl ka̱m Dee-bid, cua ka̱m Ɛ̈d-ri-el raan Mɛ-ɣo-lath ala ciekdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu Mi-kal nyaa Thɔɔl Dee-bid lɛ nhɔk. Kä cua la̱r Thɔɔl, kä cuɛ lɔcdɛ nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ lɛni car kɛ lɔcdɛ wee i̱, “A jɛ ka̱mä jɛ, dɔ̱ŋ ba mi ka̱a̱pä ni jɛ, dɔ̱ŋ ba jɛ cu näk ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt.” Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Thɔɔl Dee-bid nyɔk kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛn täämɛ bia̱ cɔw nyaadä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl la̱a̱tkɛ jiök i̱, “Ruacɛ kɛ Dee-bid gekä, jiökɛ jɛ i̱ ‘Kuäär tɛth lɔcdɛ kɛ ji̱, kä bööthkɛ diaal nhɔakɛ ji̱ ɛn täämɛ, kua̱ cɔw nyaa kua̱r.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu la̱a̱t kua̱r ruac ɛmɔ lat ji̱th Dee-bid. Kä cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “Guic yɛn ɛ täämɛ ɛ mi tɔt ɛn ɣöö bia̱ cɔw nyaa kua̱r, guɛcä jɛ kä ɣä /cɛ bi ben, ɛ ɣän can mi /ca ŋäc?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth Thɔɔl la̱r min ci Dee-bid ɛ lar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl kɛ jiök i̱, “Wiaa jiök ɛ jɛ i̱ ‘Ɛ kuäär i̱ thilɛ ɣɔ̱k kuën ti göörä, göörä ni ɣöö bi nɛy ti kuɔ̱r näk kä ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ti /ka̱n cuɛl, kɛ ɣöö ba cut kua̱r kä ji̱ tɛ̈rɛ.’ ” Nɔmɔ ɛ ca̱p mi ci Thɔɔl ɛ la̱t kɛ ɣöö ba Dee-bid cu näk ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci bööth Thɔɔl laat ti̱ti̱ ben la̱t Dee-bid, cuɛ lɔcdɛ nhɔk ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö ba cɔw nyaa kua̱r, a /ken kuën ni ben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ wä cua ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ti kur rɛw näk. Kä cuɛ nɛy ti /ka̱n cuɛl gupkiɛn ŋok kä cuɛ kɛ nööŋ, kä cuɛ kɛ thöp kuäär ni kɛ pekdiɛn kɛɛliw, kɛ ɣöö ba cɔw nyaa kua̱r. Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ ka̱m nyadɛ ni Mi-kal ala ciekdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
